the target language is: prolog.

the knowledge base time_conflicts includes these resources:
    lomo.

the knowledge base time_conflicts includes:

the text of the source description is at "sources/time_conflicts.ttl".

% Who bears a duty: the agent of this role of the action (lomo.le).
the bearer role is addresser.


notification is identified by "http://example.org/cases/time#Notification".

notification is a temporal specification.

notification has the label "Notification of the decision".

notification has the instant 2026-05-01.


appeal is identified by "http://example.org/cases/time#Appeal".

appeal is a temporal specification.

appeal has the label "Appeal period".

appeal has the instant 2026-04-01.

appeal has the duration "P1M".

appeal is timed after notification.


window is identified by "http://example.org/cases/time#Window".

window is a temporal specification.

window has the label "Consultation window".

window has the instant 2026-01-01.

window has the duration "P1M".


meeting is identified by "http://example.org/cases/time#Meeting".

meeting is a temporal specification.

meeting has the label "Consultation meeting".

meeting has the instant 2026-03-01.

meeting is timed within window.


hearing is identified by "http://example.org/cases/time#Hearing".

hearing is a temporal specification.

hearing has the label "Hearing".

hearing has the instant 2026-01-15.

hearing is timed within window.


